<p>
<strong>Proof of Proposition <a data-tag="060T" href="/tag/060T">8.4.7.5</a>.</strong>
       Combine Proposition <a data-tag="0613" href="/tag/0613">8.4.7.14</a> with Corollary <a data-tag="060Y" href="/tag/060Y">8.4.7.9</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
